Great, I can see all your devices. Here's my plan for winter mode—I'll make these changes now and you can let me know if you'd like to adjust anything:

1. **Thermostats**: Switch to heat mode with cozy winter temps
2. **Humidifier**: Turn on (winter air gets dry)
3. **Outdoor lights**: Schedule to come on earlier since it gets dark sooner
4. **Water heater**: Bump up slightly for warmer showers
5. **Garage heater**: Enable to prevent freezing

Let me set this all up:

{"name": "set_thermostat", "parameters": {"zone": "Living Room", "mode": "heat", "target_temp": 70}}

{"name": "set_thermostat", "parameters": {"zone": "Bedrooms", "mode": "heat", "target_temp": 67}}

{"name": "set_device", "parameters": {"device_id": "humidifier_whole_home", "state": "on", "attributes": {"target_humidity": 40}}}

{"name": "set_device", "parameters": {"device_id": "water_heater", "state": "on", "attributes": {"target_temp": 125}}}

{"name": "set_device", "parameters": {"device_id": "garage_heater", "state": "on", "attributes": {"target_temp": 45}}}

{"name": "set_schedule", "parameters": {"name": "winter_porch_light", "device_or_scene": "light_porch", "trigger": "17:00", "action": "turn on"}}

{"name": "set_schedule", "parameters": {"name": "winter_porch_light_off", "device_or_scene": "light_porch", "trigger": "23:30", "action": "turn off"}}

{"name": "set_schedule", "parameters": {"name": "winter_driveway_light", "device_or_scene": "light_driveway", "trigger": "17:00", "action": "turn on"}}

{"name": "set_schedule", "parameters": {"name": "winter_driveway_light_off", "device_or_scene": "light_driveway", "trigger": "23:30", "action": "turn off"}}

{"name": "set_schedule", "parameters": {"name": "winter_living_lights", "device_or_scene": "lights_living", "trigger": "17:30", "action": "turn on at 60% brightness"}}

